    Compute the inverse of a 3x3 matrix

    >>> a = jnp.array([[1., 2., 3.],
    ...                [2., 4., 2.],
    ...                [3., 2., 1.]])
    >>> a_inv = jnp.linalg.inv(a)
    >>> a_inv  # doctest: +SKIP
    Array([[ 0.        , -0.25      ,  0.5       ],
